BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Transforming Self & World: News and Views
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260125T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260125T123000
UID:c09d6d81667a7339398ea881@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:How do our views shape the way we experience the world? In thi
 s special morning event\, Vishvapani invites us to slow down and look more
  closely at the stories and headlines around us. Together we’ll explore 
 a few current stories\, and even have a go at reporting on a news event as
  factually and non-reactively as possible (easier said than done!). There
 ’ll be space to work in pairs or individually\, with plenty of guidance 
 along the way.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/transforming-self-world-
 news-and-views-2026-01-25
END:VEVENT
